,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":37.88,"default_fair_val":37.88,"premium_pct":-16.8,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":15.7,"pe_forward":13.8,"pb_trailing":2.8,"pb_forward":2.5,"div_yield":0.73,"ps_ratio":6.6,"fcf_to_ev":3.86,"fcf_to_mcap":3.8,"liab_to_assets":9.4,"cash_to_assets":4,"current_ratio":3.89,"roe":17.9,"roa":16.2,"moat":{"ticker":"TFPM","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"TFPM 屬於貴金屬領域，其產品（黃金、白銀等）本質上是商品，缺乏獨特的品牌溢價能力。公司主要透過收購和營運礦場來獲取金屬，其定價權受全球供需關係、宏觀經濟及市場情緒的影響極大，而非自身品牌價值。雖然公司在貴金屬領域有一定知名度，但與消費品品牌相比，其品牌對定價的影響力微乎其微。其商業模式更接近於商品交易，而非依賴品牌建立的護城河。","comment_en":"TFPM operates in the precious metals sector, where its products (gold, silver, etc.) are essentially commodities lacking unique brand premium power. The company primarily acquires metals through mine operations, and its pricing power is heavily influenced by global supply and demand, macroeconomic conditions, and market sentiment, rather than its own brand value. While the company has some recognition in the precious metals space, its brand's influence on pricing is minimal compared to consumer brands. Its business model is closer to commodity trading than a moat built on brand."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"貴金屬開採和冶煉行業的進入壁壘主要來自於資本投入、技術Know-how以及礦產資源的獲取，而非專利或特許經營權。TFPM 的核心業務不涉及專利保護的技術，其營運許可證的獲取也遵循行業標準，並非獨特的監管壁壘。雖然礦業開發需要遵守嚴格的環保法規，但這些法規對所有參與者都是一致的，並未形成針對 TFPM 的獨特競爭優勢。因此，此維度護城河極弱。","comment_en":"The barriers to entry in the precious metals mining and refining industry stem primarily from capital investment, technical know-how, and access to mineral resources, rather than patents or exclusive licenses. TFPM's core business does not involve patented technologies, and the acquisition of its operating permits follows industry standards, not forming a unique regulatory barrier. While mining operations must comply with strict environmental regulations, these regulations are consistent for all participants and do not create a unique competitive advantage for TFPM. Therefore, the moat in this dimension is extremely weak."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"TFPM 的客戶主要是將其生產的金屬出售給冶煉廠或金融機構，這些客戶在選擇供應商時，主要考量的是金屬的品質、價格和供應的穩定性。轉換供應商的成本相對較低，因為市場上有眾多貴金屬供應商，且產品同質性高。客戶不太可能因為轉換成本而長期綁定某一家供應商。因此，TFPM 在此維度上幾乎沒有護城河可言。","comment_en":"TFPM's customers are primarily smelters or financial institutions that purchase its produced metals. When choosing suppliers, these customers mainly consider metal quality, price, and supply stability. The cost of switching suppliers is relatively low, as there are numerous precious metal suppliers in the market and the products are highly homogeneous. Customers are unlikely to be tied to a single supplier long-term due to switching costs. Therefore, TFPM has virtually no moat in this dimension."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"網絡效應是指產品或服務的價值隨著用戶數量的增加而增加。TFPM 的業務模式是開採和銷售貴金屬，這是一個典型的 B2B 商品交易模式，與網絡效應幾乎無關。其客戶群體（冶煉廠、金融機構）的規模並不會因為 TFPM 賣出更多金屬而使其產品更有價值。公司營運的礦場也不會因為參與者增多而產生網絡效應。此維度護城河為零。","comment_en":"Network effects refer to the phenomenon where the value of a product or service increases with the number of users. TFPM's business model involves mining and selling precious metals, a typical B2B commodity trading model that is almost entirely unrelated to network effects. The size of its customer base (smelters, financial institutions) does not make its products more valuable as TFPM sells more metal. The mines operated by the company also do not generate network effects as participants increase. The moat in this dimension is zero."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"TFPM 作為一家貴金屬生產商，其規模經濟效應體現在營運效率和採購成本上。較大的生產規模有助於攤薄固定成本（如勘探、設備折舊），並可能在採購關鍵物資（如炸藥、燃料）時獲得價格優惠。此外，管理多個礦場的經驗和專業知識，也能帶來營運上的效率提升。然而，貴金屬的開採成本受礦石品位、開採難度等自然條件影響極大，規模效應的極限仍受限於資源本身。","comment_en":"As a precious metals producer, TFPM's economies of scale are reflected in operational efficiency and procurement costs. Larger production scales help spread fixed costs (such as exploration, equipment depreciation) and may allow for price advantages when purchasing critical supplies (like explosives, fuel). Furthermore, experience and expertise in managing multiple mines can lead to operational efficiency improvements. However, the extraction costs of precious metals are heavily influenced by natural conditions such as ore grade and mining difficulty, limiting the ultimate extent of scale advantages by the resources themselves."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"TFPM 的核心價值在於其擁有的貴金屬礦產資源。公司透過收購和開發具有潛力的礦產項目，建立起獨特的資產組合。這些礦產資源的地理位置、礦石品位、儲量規模等都是其獨特性的體現。成功的礦產開發需要長期的投入和專業知識，且優質礦產資源的獲取具有高度稀缺性。這些獨特的礦產資產是其最主要的護城河。","comment_en":"TFPM's core value lies in its owned precious metal mineral resources. The company builds a unique asset portfolio by acquiring and developing promising mineral projects. The geographical location, ore grade, and reserve size of these mineral resources are manifestations of their uniqueness. Successful mineral development requires long-term investment and expertise, and the acquisition of high-quality mineral resources is highly scarce. These unique mineral assets constitute its primary moat."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"TFPM 的營運效率體現在其礦場的生產管理、成本控制以及資源利用率上。公司透過持續的技術升級、優化開採流程和嚴格的成本監控，力求在保證安全和環保的前提下，最大化金屬產出並降低單位生產成本。其較高的 ROE (17.9%) 和 ROA (16.2%) 以及強勁的 FCF TTM ($246.8M) 反映了其良好的營運效率。然而，礦業的營運效率仍會受到礦石品位波動和外部環境的影響。","comment_en":"TFPM's operational efficiency is reflected in its mine production management, cost control, and resource utilization rates. Through continuous technological upgrades, optimization of extraction processes, and strict cost monitoring, the company strives to maximize metal output and reduce per-unit production costs while ensuring safety and environmental compliance. Its relatively high ROE (17.9%) and ROA (16.2%), along with strong FCF TTM ($246.8M), indicate good operational efficiency. However, mining operational efficiency can still be affected by fluctuations in ore grade and external environmental factors."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"TFPM 的管理層在資本配置方面展現出較高的水準。公司透過精準的礦產收購、有效的開發投資以及穩健的債務管理（現金遠超負債），持續為股東創造價值。其高 FCF 和穩定的股息支付能力，顯示了其將自由現金流有效分配到再投資和回報股東的能力。管理層對礦產資源的判斷和對市場時機的把握，是其資本配置成功的關鍵。","comment_en":"TFPM's management demonstrates a high level of capital allocation skill. The company consistently creates shareholder value through precise mineral acquisitions, effective development investments, and prudent debt management (cash far exceeding debt). Its high FCF and stable dividend-paying capacity indicate its ability to effectively allocate free cash flow to reinvestment and shareholder returns. Management's judgment of mineral resources and grasp of market timing are key to its successful capital allocation."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"如 M3 所述，TFPM 的客戶轉換成本低，產品同質性高，因此客戶忠誠度不高。公司主要透過提供具競爭力的價格和穩定的供應來維持客戶關係。雖然其作為貴金屬供應商的穩定性可能帶來一定的客戶黏性，但這更多是基於供應的可靠性而非強烈的客戶忠誠度。在缺乏差異化產品或服務的情況下，客戶保留面臨挑戰。","comment_en":"As mentioned in M3, TFPM's customers have low switching costs and the products are highly homogeneous, resulting in low customer loyalty. The company primarily maintains customer relationships by offering competitive prices and stable supply. While its reliability as a precious metal supplier may provide some customer stickiness, this is more based on supply dependability than strong customer loyalty. In the absence of differentiated products or services, customer retention faces challenges."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"TFPM 的護城河耐久性主要來自其擁有的優質礦產資源（M6）和持續的營運效率（M7）。貴金屬資源的稀缺性和開採的長期性，賦予了其業務較長的生命週期。只要管理層能持續有效地配置資本（M8）並維持營運優勢，其競爭地位就能保持相對穩定。然而，礦業的週期性、商品價格波動以及潛在的環境法規變化，都可能對其耐久性構成挑戰。","comment_en":"TFPM's moat durability primarily stems from its high-quality mineral resources (M6) and sustained operational efficiency (M7). The scarcity of precious metal resources and the long-term nature of mining grant its business a relatively long lifecycle. As long as management can continue to allocate capital effectively (M8) and maintain operational advantages, its competitive position can remain relatively stable. However, the cyclical nature of mining, commodity price volatility, and potential changes in environmental regulations could pose challenges to its durability."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"TFPM 的護城河主要建立在其獨特的貴金屬礦產資產（M6）和相對穩健的營運效率（M7）之上，這使其具備一定的商品型特許經營權特徵。其規模經濟（M5）和資本配置能力（M8）也提供了支持。然而，公司缺乏品牌定價權（M1）、專利壁壘（M2）、網絡效應（M4）和客戶轉換成本（M3、M9），這限制了其護城河的深度和廣度。整體而言，TFPM 擁有一個基於資源的、相對穩固但非無懈可擊的護城河，其耐久性依賴於資源的持續開採和管理層的卓越資本配置。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"TFPM's moat is primarily built upon its unique precious metal mineral assets (M6) and relatively robust operational efficiency (M7), giving it characteristics of a resource-based franchise. Its economies of scale (M5) and capital allocation capabilities (M8) also provide support. However, the company lacks brand pricing power (M1), patent barriers (M2), network effects (M4), and customer switching costs (M3, M9), which limit the depth and breadth of its moat. Overall, TFPM possesses a relatively solid but not impregnable resource-based moat, whose durability depends on the continued extraction of resources and excellent capital allocation by management.","evidenceHash":"317ab0259475f2019f06ae397326ef6940bf5daffada8c0a13ebadd68126b6bd","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null,"evidenceHash":"317ab0259475f2019f06ae397326ef6940bf5daffada8c0a13ebadd68126b6bd","currentEvidenceHash":"317ab0259475f2019f06ae397326ef6940bf5daffada8c0a13ebadd68126b6bd"},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-08T14:00:18.999Z","evidenceHash":"b4579b0f69ec8baca04282644f9ebe6530385325edb5577926eef5d02a02cfee"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"windowDressing","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-08T14:00:18.999Z","evidenceHash":"b4579b0f69ec8baca04282644f9ebe6530385325edb5577926eef5d02a02cfee"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/TFPM.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/TFPM.png","website":"https://www.tripleflagpm.com","ceo":"Sheldon Vanderkooy","full_time_employees":"20","description":"Triple Flag Precious Metals Corp., a precious metals streaming and royalty company, engages in acquiring and managing precious metals, streams, royalties, and other mineral interests in Australia, Canada, Colombia, Cote d’Ivoire, Mexico, Mongolia, Peru, South Africa, and the United States. The company has a portfolio of streams and royalties providing exposure to copper, gold, silver, nickel, lead, lithium, and zinc. The company was founded in 2016 and is based in Toronto, Canada.","description_en":"Triple Flag Precious Metals Corp., a precious metals streaming and royalty company, engages in acquiring and managing precious metals, streams, royalties, and other mineral interests in Australia, Canada, Colombia, Cote d’Ivoire, Mexico, Mongolia, Peru, South Africa, and the United States. The company has a portfolio of streams and royalties providing exposure to copper, gold, silver, nickel, lead, lithium, and zinc. The company was founded in 2016 and is based in Toronto, Canada.","description_zh":"Triple Flag Precious Metals Corp.（美股代碼：TFPM）為 Basic Materials 領域之重要企業，專注於 Other Precious Metals 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"TD Canada Trust Tower","city":"Toronto","state":"ON","zip":"M5J 2S1","country":"CA","phone":"416 304 9741","full_address":"TD Canada Trust Tower, Toronto, ON M5J 2S1, CA","range_52w":"26.61-41.7","year_high":41.7,"year_low":26.61,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":26.61,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"in